{"id":"torrey:miraculous-gifts-of-the-holy-spirit","source":"torrey","name":"Miraculous Gifts Of The Holy Spirit","slug":"miraculous-gifts-of-the-holy-spirit","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Foretold — Isa 35:4-6; Joe 2:28,29.","refs":[["Isa",35,4,35,6],["Joel",2,28,2,28],["Joel",2,29,2,29]]},{"text":"Of different kinds — 1Co 12:4-6.","refs":[["1Cor",12,4,12,6]]},{"text":"Enumerated — 1Co 12:8-10,28; 14:1.","refs":[["1Cor",12,8,12,10],["1Cor",12,28,12,28],["1Cor",14,1,14,1]]},{"text":"Christ was endued with — Mt 12:28.","refs":[["Matt",12,28,12,28]]},{"text":"Poured out on the day of Pentecost — Ac 2:1-4.","refs":[["Acts",2,1,2,4]]},{"text":"Upon the preaching of the gospel. — Ac 10:44-46.","refs":[["Acts",10,44,10,46]]},{"text":"By the laying on of the Apostles’ hands. — Ac 8:17,18; 19:6.","refs":[["Acts",8,17,8,17],["Acts",8,18,8,18],["Acts",19,6,19,6]]},{"text":"For the confirmation of the gospel. — Mr 16:20; Ac 14:3; Ro 15:19; Heb 2:4.","refs":[["Mark",16,20,16,20],["Acts",14,3,14,3],["Rom",15,19,15,19],["Heb",2,4,2,4]]},{"text":"For the edification of the Church. — 1Co 12:7; 14:12,13.","refs":[["1Cor",12,7,12,7],["1Cor",14,12,14,12],["1Cor",14,13,14,13]]},{"text":"Dispensed according to his sovereign will — 1Co 12:11.","refs":[["1Cor",12,11,12,11]]},{"text":"Were to be sought after — 1Co 12:31; 14:1.","refs":[["1Cor",12,31,12,31],["1Cor",14,1,14,1]]},{"text":"Temporary nature of — 1Co 13:8.","refs":[["1Cor",13,8,13,8]]},{"text":"Neglected. — 1Ti 4:14; 2Ti 1:6.","refs":[["1Tim",4,14,4,14],["2Tim",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Despised. — 1Th 5:20.","refs":[["1Thess",5,20,5,20]]},{"text":"Purchased. — Ac 8:20.","refs":[["Acts",8,20,8,20]]},{"text":"Might be possessed without saving grace — Mt 7:22,23; 1Co 13:1,2.","refs":[["Matt",7,22,7,22],["Matt",7,23,7,23],["1Cor",13,1,13,1],["1Cor",13,2,13,2]]},{"text":"Counterfeited by Antichrist — Mt 24:24; 2Th 2:9; Re 13:13,14.","refs":[["Matt",24,24,24,24],["2Thess",2,9,2,9],["Rev",13,13,13,13],["Rev",13,14,13,14]]}],"refCount":36